    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The story in brief</strong></h2><br>A message from a friend who has been missing for almost a year catches your attention and upon arriving at the venue as requested you discover a beautiful modern mansion complete with a stunning outdoor garden. Upon entering the property you discover that you are now trapped and must find a way to escape.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Minor details are important</strong></h2><br>Try and escape the House by paying close attention to various audio cues and visual details that might give you a hint at the house's weaknesses, while also discovering clues relating to previous unfortunates who fell victim to the house and were unable to escape.<br><br>Be vary when interacting with the various objects scattered throughout the house since some objects tend to create various incidents that may hinder your ability to escape.",
